{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_absorb.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/gif25_absorb.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto can absorb objects from the environment and instantly take on their unique abilities, from powerful attacks to downright silly tricks. Experiment with different forms to solve puzzles, outsmart the shadow creatures, and discover new ways to explore the vibrant worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_coop.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-1b7d5e7724dcc4.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly everything in life is better when you've got some help. Teeto is no different! Partner up to tackle the world in split screen co-op! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_shadow.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-15459d9eae0763.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The shadow creatures are malevolent beings that spread decay, draining the world of its color and life. Teeto and Nory must work together to defeat the shadow creatures, cleansing their corruption and restoring life to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_michael.png?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-1c5f8b24c0494a.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto wasn\u2019t Nory\u2019s first experiment. One of them was named Michael. But Michael went and split himself into two, then four, then eight\u2014until there were way too many for any bunny to handle! Now, the Michaels are lost, scattered across the world. Find them, rescue them, bring them home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_friends.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-1085c2d9c2d533.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along your journey, you'll encounter a cast of wild and quirky characters, each with their own eccentric personalities and... problems. Lend them a hand, and they might just return the favor with useful items, hidden secrets, or unexpected abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_outfits.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Gif_Outfits.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto can unlock a variety of fun and stylish costumes, from the effortlessly cool to the downright ridiculous. Saving the world is important - but who says you can\u2019t look fashionable while doing it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783370?t=1739491423","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2783370?t=1739491423","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/d2e2a1b0c7099097b8c8807e849155be31e269be/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1739491423","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/d2e2a1b0c7099097b8c8807e849155be31e269be/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1739491423","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":2953830,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_absorb.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/gif25_absorb.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto can absorb objects from the environment and instantly take on their unique abilities, from powerful attacks to downright silly tricks. Experiment with different forms to solve puzzles, outsmart the shadow creatures, and discover new ways to explore the vibrant worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_coop.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-1b7d5e7724dcc4.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Nearly everything in life is better when you've got some help. Teeto is no different! Partner up to tackle the world in split screen co-op! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_shadow.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-15459d9eae0763.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The shadow creatures are malevolent beings that spread decay, draining the world of its color and life. Teeto and Nory must work together to defeat the shadow creatures, cleansing their corruption and restoring life to the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_michael.png?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-1c5f8b24c0494a.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto wasn\u2019t Nory\u2019s first experiment. One of them was named Michael. But Michael went and split himself into two, then four, then eight\u2014until there were way too many for any bunny to handle! Now, the Michaels are lost, scattered across the world. Find them, rescue them, bring them home! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_friends.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/ezgif-1085c2d9c2d533.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Along your journey, you'll encounter a cast of wild and quirky characters, each with their own eccentric personalities and... problems. Lend them a hand, and they might just return the favor with useful items, hidden secrets, or unexpected abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Title_outfits.png?t=1739491423\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/extras/Gif_Outfits.gif?t=1739491423\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teeto can unlock a variety of fun and stylish costumes, from the effortlessly cool to the downright ridiculous. Saving the world is important - but who says you can\u2019t look fashionable while doing it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Eat Pant Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2783370/header.jpg?t=1739491423","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257096394,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096394/movie480.mp4?t=1739459087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096394/movie_max.mp4?t=1739459087"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257096394/1231f73cd4b054c9c70a4d1a9bb617932e8f20dc/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739459087","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096394/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739459087","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257096394/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1739459087"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257046666,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046666/movie480.mp4?t=1739197808","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046666/movie_max.mp4?t=1739197808"},"name":"Welcome to Shadowtown!","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257046666/2952df5d8be147cf18dbd0d7ca29d7e14a83faa4/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1739197808","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046666/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1739197808","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257046666/movie_m